# Provider environment belongs in INSTALL_DIR/data/research/provider.env.
# The packaged Node host reads it with --env-file; the installer never sources it.
# Use the variable names supported by your native pi-ai provider, for example:
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=...
# Remote Nautilus tokenEnv entries use the same private file, for example:
# QZ_RESEARCH_NAUTILUS_TOKEN=...
# QZ_PAPER_NAUTILUS_TOKEN=...
# QZ_LIVE_NAUTILUS_TOKEN=...
# Never place credentials in research inputs, tool arguments or installation.json.
